    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The transport company will issue an official consignment bilty. For shipments involving military zones like Jalandhar Cantt, this bilty must be IBA (Indian Business Association) approved or standardized. This document tracks the journey, details the pickup and drop-off locations, and acts as the legal contract between you and the transporter.</p>
