<h3>100% Declared-Value Marine Transit Insurance</h3>
<p>Beyond the standard vehicle insurance, it is imperative to avail of dedicated transit coverage. We strongly recommend opting for <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. This specialized policy protects your bike against physical damage, theft, or accidental loss specifically during the logistics journey.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Unlike standard policies, which may have wear-and-tear exclusions, marine transit insurance covers the vehicle from the moment it is loaded onto the transporter’s vehicle until it is unloaded at your destination in Jalandhar Cantt.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>By declaring the full market value of your bike, you ensure complete financial protection against any unforeseen incidents, providing total peace of mind.</span></li></ul>
<p>Prepare these documents meticulously to avoid last-minute issues. A well-documented shipment ensures quick clearance at the Jalandhar Cantt entry points and a hassle-free handover. Verify every detail on the bilty and insurance policy before signing. Your attention to these legal and administrative details guarantees a secure, efficient, and transparent relocation process for your two-wheeler.</p></div>
